{
  "id": "linux_smarthome_670",
  "instruction": "`/tmp/protection/current-diagram.png` and `/tmp/protection/current-manifest.json` on the first Linux machine list the current protected rooms and active window; `/tmp/protection/plan-audit.xlsx` on the second Linux machine is for auditing future plans. Please query SmartHome, cancel any item inside the window that would change a protected room without an exception, and complete the audit.",
